        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to an adrenaline-filled car parkour experience that blends challenging platforms, deadly traps, and fast-paced driving! Prove your skills solo, or race with a friend in 2-player mode to reach the finish line. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players use their own unique set of abilities to progress through each course: Super Jump: Leap over high obstacles and escape tight spots with ease. Push Ability: Help your friend by pushing them out of tricky areas—or send them straight into traps and slow zones. Speed Boost: Gain a burst of speed at critical moments to secure your path to victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner is filled with deadly platforms, slowing traps, and distracting moving obstacles designed to sabotage your run. Each level offers a unique challenge that tests your reflexes, timing, and decision-making. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun gameplay for solo players or 2-player co-op/versus</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based parkour mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special abilities to complete courses and create speed strategies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative platform designs packed with lethal traps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect opportunities to sabotage your friend</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Reaching the finish line may be easy… but truly winning requires both strategy and skill. Are you ready? The parkour challenge awaits.</p>",
